      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have formerly used full unredacted avatar IDs from the debug UI extensively to investigate potentially abusive public avatars (to report to Trust & Safety, with screenshots; e.g. ticket #639757). Sometimes, these public avatars have not been indexed by Prismic's Avatar Search or such, and can only be found and changed into with an avatar ID.\n\nCurrently, the redacted avatar IDs create additional friction for investigation by requiring me to additionally:\n\n1. Enable full debug logs;\n\n2. Change my Maximum Download Size to 0 MB in Avatar Optimizations settings;\n\n3. I may need rejoin the current world, or clear my avatar cache and restart VRChat;\n\n4. Find the appropriate unredacted `[AssetBundleDownloadManager] Avatar 'avtr_[...]' did not pass initial checks and won't be downloaded: AssetBundleBadPerformance` or `AssetBundleSizeTooLarge` line from VRChat's debug logs for the full unredacted avatar ID.\n\n5. Restore my former settings to download avatars again (and disable debug logs).",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
