      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Regarding unnecessary friction and workarounds:\n\nI had to (ab)use an avatar moderation report in-client and check my open reports with full debug logs to grab [a Very Poor rated private avatar ID that was being loaded as a fallback](https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/a-very-poor-rated-avatar-452-293-triangles-is-being-loaded-as-a-fallback-avatar) for a bug report, while the full avatar ID was redacted in the debug UI and never appeared in AssetBundleDownloadManager errors.\n\n```\n\n2025.12.20 02:37:40 Error      -  [API] [171, 404, Get, -1 https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/avatars/avtr_2c03efc2-cf7a-44a7-8416-87d68a3b3919] Abandoning request, because - Avatar Not Found\n\n```\n\nThis avatar ID was then correlated with download size and a redacted avatar ID from the debug UI.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
