  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "In VRChat 2025.4.1 and earlier, the avatar IDs used to appear in the debug UI unredacted.\n\nSince VRChat 2025.4.2's major overhaul of Debug UI, avatar IDs are shown in redacted form in Shift + Tilde + 1 menu: `avtr_[first 8 hex]_****-****-****-************`.\n\nPlease restore the former behavior of listing a history of unredacted avatar IDs, to avoid unnecessary workarounds and friction.\n\nOld & new debug UI screenshots attached for comparison.",
